// # emit-x86 parenthesized const-int ALU
//
// Logline: Print (1 + 2) times 3 so emit-x86 can lower a paren group to 9.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print (1 + 2) times 3.
//   3. as+ld stdout is 9, not 123.
//
// residual: C precedence without parens stays later.

pub fn main() {
    println((1 + 2) * 3);
}
